# The same street, a robotaxi: the moment the skater is in its lane ahead it stops dead (14 m/s^2,
# robotaxiStop), its hazards blink after hazardAfter (0.4 s), and it chimes (honk, robo) after 1.2 s.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -50.9 -311.76 2.41 0
cmd 2 car -51.1 -331.2 356 8 robo
run 320
expect event robotaxiStop within 78..86
expect min car.gap > 11
expect car.car.speed < 0.01 at 170
expect car.car.hazard == 1 at 220
expect event honk{robo=true} within 280..300
expect no event carHit
